@page "/replay"

<PageTitle>Replay · PrimeScore Markets</PageTitle>

<div class="page-head">
    <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Point-in-time replay</div>
        <h1>Replay</h1>
        <p>Re-run a validation event or date range using only data available at each moment, optionally with overridden configuration, and compare with the expected outcome.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<EmptyState Title="Replay is not available yet">
    Replay and the validation-set report arrive in milestone M5 (SRS ANA-001). Replay results describe what the rules would have decided; they are not a backtest of returns.
</EmptyState>
